NOTE ON NON-CODE ASSETS

This MIT license covers the ToolForge source code, benchmark task definitions,
and generated datasets produced by this repository.

It does NOT cover third-party model weights (e.g. Qwen3 checkpoints from Hugging
Face). Those remain under their own upstream licenses (Qwen3 models are
distributed under Apache 2.0 / Qwen community licenses depending on size and
release; check the model card before redistributing). ToolForge distributes
LoRA adapters, which inherit constraints from the base model license — review
the base model's terms before publishing adapters or merged weights.
